# Strip Mine destroys it and The Ooze makes nothing: it is not a creature as it leaves the battlefield (CR 603.10a). The
# first Mutagen token, from The Ooze's tap ability on turn 1 (exiling Bot1's Bolt), was sacrificed for the counter.

